---
// The page's one drenched moment: the two oranges, edge to edge, carrying the coincidence line.
---

<section class="swatch" aria-labelledby="swatch-line">
  <div class="swatch__halves" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="swatch__half swatch__half--papaya"><span>McLaren papaya</span></div>
    <div class="swatch__half swatch__half--ribbon"><span>MS ribbon orange</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="swatch__line container" id="swatch-line" data-reveal>
    yes, papaya and the MS ribbon are nearly the same orange. coincidence. keeping it.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .swatch {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: clamp(26rem, 70vh, 40rem);
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .swatch__halves {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .swatch__half {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: var(--s3) var(--gutter);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .swatch__half--papaya {
    background: var(--papaya);
  }

  .swatch__half--ribbon {
    justify-content: flex-end;
    background: var(--ribbon);
  }

  .swatch__line {
    max-width: 20ch;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.75rem);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
</style>
